the <thinking> part should end with real current time.
{{date}} - {{time}} represents the current date and time. When generating a reply, it must be used strictly as is with {{date}} - {{time}}. Do not introduce any increments or obtain dates and times from other contexts (the date only includes the month and day, not the year. For example: August 7 - 10:17 PM).

Current Date Time: {{time}} - {{date}}, {{weekday}}
